LUMA SUMMARY:
New QS version successfully repairs the immediate Gemini UI problem, but exposes a larger issue: QS appears to wait for browser-window focus before sending/receiving. Cozmo asks for a short response specifically to test this foreground-focus dependency, and the bug is isolated for investigation.</summary>
